OL,3,AMan charged with manslaughter in
OL,4,Aburglary case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after a 75-year-old woman
OL,8,Fdied following a suspected burglary in
OL,9,Fnorth London.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Tollington Park
OL,12,Fin Finsbury Park on the night of 11
OL,13,FAugust after reports of a burglary.
OL,15,FRose Smith was taken to hospital, where
OL,16,Fshe died the following day. An
OL,17,F81-year-old man was also taken to
OL,18,Fhospital and was discharged the next
OL,19,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
