OL,3,AMan charged with manslaughter in
OL,4,Aburglary case
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeffrey Dean Rose, 46, of Apsley Close,
OL,7,FNorth Harrow, has been charged with
OL,8,Fmanslaughter and aggravated burglary.
OL,9,FHe is due to appear at Barkingside
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday.
